{"page":"TRRAP","gene":"TRRAP","accession":"Q9Y4A5","protein":"Transformation/transcription domain-associated protein","length":3859,"events":["Alternative splicing"],"canonical":{"accession":"Q9Y4A5-1","name":"1","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000359863.8"],"refseq":["NM_001244580.2"],"refseqProteins":["NP_001231509.1"],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"model":null},"features":[{"type":"Modified residue","start":2,"end":2,"description":"N-acetylalanine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":1628,"end":1628,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Region","start":2010,"end":2388,"description":"Interaction with TP53"},{"type":"Motif","start":2047,"end":2062,"description":"Bipartite nuclear localization signal"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":2051,"end":2051,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":2077,"end":2077,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Cross-link","start":2543,"end":2543,"description":"Glycyl lysine isopeptide (Lys-Gly) (interchain with G-Cter in SUMO2)"},{"type":"Domain","start":2692,"end":3275,"description":"FAT"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":3078,"end":3078,"description":"N6-acetyllysine"},{"type":"Domain","start":3500,"end":3823,"description":"PI3K/PI4K catalytic"},{"type":"Region","start":3506,"end":3512,"description":"G-loop"},{"type":"Region","start":3687,"end":3695,"description":"Catalytic loop"},{"type":"Region","start":3707,"end":3732,"description":"Activation loop"},{"type":"Domain","start":3827,"end":3859,"description":"FATC"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Interacts with MYC, E2F1 and E2F4 transcription factors. Interacts directly with p53/TP53. Interacts with GCN5L2. Component of various HAT complexes. Component of the PCAF complex, at least composed of TADA2L/ADA2, SUPT3H, TADA3L/ADA3, TAF5L/PAF65-beta, TAF6L/PAF65-alpha, TAF10/TAFII30, TAF12/TAFII20, TAF9/TAFII31 and TRRAP. Component of the TFTC-HAT complex, at least composed of TAF5L, TAF6L, TADA3L, SUPT3H/SPT3, TAF2/TAFII150, TAF4/TAFII135, TAF5/TAFII100, GCN5L2/GCN5, TAF10 and TRRAP. Component of the NuA4 histone acetyltransferase complex which contains the catalytic subunit KAT5/TIP60 and the subunits EP400, TRRAP/PAF400, BRD8/SMAP, EPC1, DMAP1/DNMAP1, RUVBL1/TIP49, RUVBL2, ING3, actin, ACTL6A/BAF53A, MORF4L1/MRG15, MORF4L2/MRGX, MRGBP, YEATS4/GAS41, VPS72/YL1 and MEAF6. Component of the STAGA complex, at least composed of SUPT3H, GCN5L2, SUPT7L, TAF5L, TAF6L, TADA3L, TAD1L, TAF10, TAF12, TRRAP and TAF9. The STAGA core complex is associated with a subcomplex required for histone deubiquitination composed of ATXN7L3, ENY2 and USP22. Component of the BAF53 complex, at least composed of BAF53A, RUVBL1, SMARCA4/BRG1, and TRRAP, which preferentially acetylates histone H4 (and H2A) within nucleosomes. Interacts with NPAT. Interaction with TELO2 and TTI1. Component of a SWR1-like complex"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"Q9Y4A5-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":3830,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000355540.7"],"refseq":["NM_003496.4"],"refseqProteins":["NP_003487.1"],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,1491],[1492,1510,1491],[2984,3013,847]],"edits":[{"start":1492,"end":1509,"original":"ESISECGRCPLSPFCQFE","replacement":"","added":0},{"start":3001,"end":3012,"original":"GKPTWSGMHSSS","replacement":"A","added":1}],"missing":30,"replaced":0,"novel":1,"foldedAbsent":null,"foldedMissing":null,"features":[[7,12,0]],"interfaces":{},"model":null}],"ensemblGenes":["ENSG00000196367.15"],"unmapped":{"ensembl":[],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[]},"coding":{"genes":[{"id":"ENSG00000196367","name":"TRRAP","chromosome":"chr7","readthrough":false}],"gencode":4,"mapped":2},"explorer":{"gene":null,"isoforms":null},"locus":"chr7:98878473-99013243","exons":{"transcript":"ENST00000359863.8","first":2,"junctions":[100,150,261,366,450,507,633,711,800,897,1036,1115,1350,1714,1812,2007,2199,2365,2622,2823,2975,3175,3393,3591,3852,4014,